   "rdfs:label": "Amos Tversky",
   "skos:altLabel": "Tversky",
   "skos:definition": "Israeli-American cognitive psychologist (1937-1996) who, largely with Daniel Kahneman, showed that intuitive judgment under uncertainty relies on a few heuristics that produce systematic biases, and who co-created prospect theory.",
